==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|seed|ling}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# which is a seedling (see below)

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|botany|lang=en}} A young [[plant]] grown from [[seed]]
# Any young, especially
## one grown in a [[nursery]] for transplanting
## a tree smaller than a [[sapling]].

